Keep a shared lowers as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into lowers.
Keep a shared uppers as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into uppers.
Keep a shared word as empty text.
Place "a1b2" into word.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared piece as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared letterindex as 0.

To seek from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The lowpiece is the slice of lowers from spot to spot plus 1.
If lowpiece matches piece, set found to 1, set letterindex to spot, return.
The uppiece is the slice of uppers from spot to spot plus 1.
If uppiece matches piece, set found to 1, set letterindex to spot, return.
Seek from spot plus 1.

To build from spot (a whole number).
If spot is 4, The copy is a copy of current, Place copy into answers, then return.
The symbol is the slice of word from spot to spot plus 1.
Set piece to symbol.
Set found to 0.
Seek from 0.
The here is found.
The holdindex is letterindex.
If here is 0, Place symbol into current, build from spot plus 1, remove last character from current.
If here is 1, The little is the slice of lowers from holdindex to holdindex plus 1, Place little into current, build from spot plus 1, remove last character from current.
If here is 1, The big is the slice of uppers from holdindex to holdindex plus 1, Place big into current, build from spot plus 1, remove last character from current.

Build from 0.
For each answer in answers, show answer.
